This repository holds two things: MsgFacade.dll, a macro-free facade over
Msgcore.dll's structured message store, and MsgcoreCom.dll (in com\), an ATL
in-proc COM server built on that facade. Msgcore itself is a separate
repository under the same licence and is NOT bundled here.


